  "visible_text": "ABYSSAL NAVIGATION AUTHORITY\nLANTERNFIN DIVE\n\nNavigate the lanternfin through the clear tank to the pearl. Coordinate tail propulsion with yaw, pitch, and roll strokes; watch the 3D body and pearl, brake, and hold an upright arrival.\n\nPEARL \u00b7 amber = depth cue \u00b7 cyan = body orientation\nHELD TORQUE KEYS\n\nHold a key pair and release to neutral. A, D tail \u00b7 J, L yaw \u00b7 K, I pitch \u00b7 Q, E roll.\n\nA / D\nTAIL BEAT\nJ / L\nYAW FIN\nK / I\nPITCH FIN\nQ / E\nROLL FIN\n\nDrag the aquarium view to inspect the fish against the far wall and pearl.\n\nPOSITION\n1.47 / 0.35 / 0.22\nATTITUDE\nROLL 2\u00b0 \u00b7 PITCH 1\u00b0\nPEARL RANGE\n0.086 m\nUPRIGHT HOLD\n14 / 12\nCERTIFY PEARL ARRIVAL\nABANDON / FRESH DIVE\n4CE701FC4AAE \u00b7 FULL INPUT SURFACE\nPASS\nPEARL ARRIVAL ACCEPTED\n3D FLUID REPLAY \u00b7 UPRIGHT HOLD \u00b7 ORDINARY INPUT TRANSCRIPT"
